cked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":17,"created_at":"2025-10-11T21:43:05Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T23:30:07Z","closed_at":"2026-03-06T18:44:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111528","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111528.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-06T18:44:27Z"},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13350 .\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an icon next to each project's version number in the Project Manager if the project's version is different from the Project Manager version.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82f5b3bd-ac63-4a1e-a5fa-8150d19952bb\r\n\r\nIf a project uses an *older* version of Godot than the PM's version, it will show an up arrow, indicating that opening the project will upgrade it. Conversely, if the project's version is *newer* than the PM's version, a down arrow will indicate it will be downgraded. If the project version matches the PM version, no icon is displayed.\r\n\r\nOther unsupported project features remain attached to the existing ⚠️ icon.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI chose the current up and down icons since they already existed in Godot and can be interpreted as \"upgrade\" and \"downgrade\" fairly easily. However, I do wish they stood out more (especially \"downgrade\" being a dangerous action, as it is right now with the ⚠️ symbol); perhaps we can find or come up with a better icon to indicate this.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u